                             title="Measured: compression and tool-schema deferral. Projected: extension-attributed estimates such as model routing."></div>
                        <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"
                             x-text="'$' + formatCurrency(stats.summary?.cost?.with_headroom_usd || 0) + ' spent vs $' + formatCurrency(stats.summary?.cost?.without_headroom_usd || 0) + ' baseline'"
                             title="Spend is input + output at the provider's billed rates."></div>
                        <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-cyan-600 leading-relaxed"
                             x-text="'+ $' + formatCurrency(stats.summary?.cost?.provider_cache_discount_usd || 0) + ' provider cache discount'"
                             title="Discount the provider gives on prompt-cache reads. Headroom's CacheAligner and prefix freeze raise the hit rate, but the discount is provider-native, so it is not counted as Headroom savings."></div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Output Tokens Saved (counterfactual) -->
                    <div class="bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 border border-border">
